---
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
import ProfileImage from "../assets/profile.jpeg";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <div class="mb-14 flex flex-col-reverse gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
    <div>
      <p class="mb-3 font-mono text-sm text-muted">
        <span class="text-accent">$</span> whoami
      </p>
      <h1 class="mb-4 font-mono text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
        soyeong choi<span class="text-accent">_</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mb-6 font-mono text-sm text-muted">
        Node.js software engineer · Seoul
      </p>
      <button
        id="toggle-lang"
        class="cursor-pointer rounded border border-line px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent"
      >
        --lang=en
      </button>
    </div>
    <Image
      class="h-auto w-40 rounded-lg border border-line grayscale-[30%] md:w-52"
      src={ProfileImage}
      width={416}
      loading="eager"
      alt="최소영 프로필 사진"
    />
  </div>

  <div id="resume-ko">
    <section>
      <p>문제를 빠르게 진단하고 구조적으로 해결하는 개발자 최소영입니다.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>About</h2>
      <hr />
      <p>5년 차 Node.js 소프트웨어 엔지니어입니다.</p>
      <p>
        Node.js와 Nest.js 기반으로 대규모 트래픽에 대응한 경험이 있으며,
        서버리스 아키텍처 설계와 Redis 캐시 시스템 도입을 통해 응답 속도를 최대
        60% 개선한 바 있습니다.
      </p>
      <p>
        트래픽 이슈, 병목 현상 등을 빠르게 진단하고 구조적으로 해결하는 실전
        감각을 갖추고 있으며, 필요에 따라 프론트엔드 개발도 주도적으로 참여해
        왔습니다.
      </p>
      <p>
        특정 언어나 기술에 국한되지 않고, 문제 해결을 위해 가장 적합한 도구를
        유연하게 선택하려 노력합니다. 다양한 분야에 대한 관심과 경험을 통해
        꾸준히 성장하는 개발자가 되고자 합니다.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Skill</h2>
      <hr />
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="min-w-full">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>분야</th>
              <th>스택</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Language</td>
              <td>TypeScript, JavaScript, Python</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Backend</td>
              <td>Node.js, Nest.js</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Frontend</td>
              <td>React.js, Next.js</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Infra</td>
              <td
                >AWS Lambda, S3, CloudFront, DynamoDB, ElastiCache, AppSync, SQS</td
              >
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>DB</td>
              <td>DynamoDB, Redis</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>DevOps</td>
              <td>CloudWatch, Slack Alert, CI/CD (Bitbucket Pipelines)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>기타</td>
              <td>실시간 로그 수집, 비용 최적화 설계 경험 다수</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Work Experience</h2>
      <hr />
      <p>
        <a href="https://www.kinx.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">KINX</a>
        CDN 개발 그룹 매니저: 2020 ~ · 소프트웨어 개발 엔지니어
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <hr />
      <ul>
        <li><strong>2015 - 2020</strong> 단국대학교 소프트웨어공학과</li>
        <li><strong>2018 - 2019</strong> 캐나다 어학연수</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Certification</h2>
      <hr />
      <ul>
        <li>AWS Certified Developer - Associate</li>
        <li>AWS Solutions Architecture</li>
        <li>AWS Practitioner</li>
        <li>SQLD</li>
        <li>정보처리기사</li>
        <li>OPIC - IH</li>
        <li>
          CILISAT (Community Interpreter Language and Interpreting Skills
          Assessment Tool)
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contacts</h2>
      <hr />
      <p>✉️ Email - <em>simc2644@gmail.com</em></p>
      <h3>🐱 Github</h3>
      <p>
        <a
          class="underline"
          href="https://github.com/so0choi"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">https://github.com/so0choi</a
        >
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div id="resume-en" style="display:none">
    <p>
      I’m Soyoung Choi, a developer who diagnoses issues quickly and solves them
      systematically.
    </p>
    <section>
      <h2>About</h2>
      <hr />
      <p>Node.js software engineer with 5 years of experience.</p>
      <p>
        Experienced with high-traffic services on Node.js and NestJS. Improved
        response time by up to 60% through serverless architecture design and
        Redis-based caching.
      </p>
      <p>
        Skilled at pinpointing bottlenecks and production issues, with hands-on
        experience across both backend and, when needed, frontend work.
      </p>
      <p>
        I choose tools pragmatically, not dogmatically—using what best solves
        the problem.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <hr />
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="min-w-full">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Field</th>
              <th>Stack</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Language</td>
              <td>TypeScript, JavaScript, Python</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Backend</td>
              <td>Node.js, NestJS</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Frontend</td>
              <td>React, Next.js</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Infra</td>
              <td
                >AWS Lambda, S3, CloudFront, DynamoDB, ElastiCache, AppSync, SQS</td
              >
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>DB</td>
              <td>DynamoDB, Redis</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>DevOps</td>
              <td>CloudWatch, Slack Alerting, CI/CD (Bitbucket Pipelines)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Etc.</td>
              <td>Real-time log collection, cost-optimization architecture</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Work Experience</h2>
      <hr />
      <p>
        <a href="https://www.kinx.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">KINX</a>
        CDN Development Group Manager: 2020 – Present · Software Engineer
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <hr />
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>2015 – 2020</strong> Dankook University, Software Engineering
        </li>
        <li><strong>2018 – 2019</strong> English Language Program, Canada</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Certifications</h2>
      <hr />
      <ul>
        <li>AWS Certified Developer – Associate</li>
        <li>AWS Solutions Architect</li>
        <li>AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner</li>
        <li>SQLD</li>
        <li>Engineer Information Processing (Korea)</li>
        <li>OPIC – IH</li>
        <li>
          CILISAT (Community Interpreter Language and Interpreting Skills
          Assessment Tool)
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contacts</h2>
      <hr />
      <p>✉️ Email — <em>simc2644@gmail.com</em></p>
      <h3>🐱 Github</h3>
      <p>
        <a
          class="underline"
          href="https://github.com/so0choi"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">https://github.com/so0choi</a
        >
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <script>
    const btn = document.getElementById("toggle-lang");
    const ko = document.getElementById("resume-ko");
    const en = document.getElementById("resume-en");
    btn?.addEventListener("click", () => {
      const enVisible = en && en.style.display !== "none";
      if (enVisible) {
        en.style.display = "none";
        ko.style.display = "";
        btn.textContent = "--lang=en";
      } else {
        en.style.display = "";
        ko.style.display = "none";
        btn.textContent = "--lang=ko";
      }
    });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  #resume-ko,
  #resume-en {
    max-width: 72ch;
    color: #d3ddd8;
  }
  #resume-ko > :global(p),
  #resume-en > :global(p),
  section {
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }
  section :global(h2) {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono-stack);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  section :global(h2)::before {
    content: "## ";
    color: var(--dim);
  }
  section :global(h3) {
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0.25rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  section :global(hr) {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }
  section :global(p) {
    margin: 0 0 0.9em;
  }
  section :global(ul) {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.2em;
  }
  section :global(li) {
    list-style: "- ";
    margin-bottom: 0.3em;
  }
  section :global(li::marker) {
    color: var(--dim);
  }
  section :global(a) {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
